{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe air here is sharp, and the light on the Seine tonight is unlike anything we have seen in Berlin. I have been to Saint-Denis and Montmorency. The cathedral at Saint-Denis is draped in black for a recent funeral; it is a heavy, solemn sight, reminding one that even kings are subject to the march of history. From Montmorency, I rode a donkey to Rousseau’s Hermitage. It is a modest place, but the view from the heights above the town is commanding. I could see all of Paris, with Montmartre rising in the distance. It struck me how the capital looks from here—not as a city of noise, but as a vast, living organism of the spirit. The journey has been tiring, but the mind is refreshed. I miss your presence and the comfort of our home. Do not worry about me; I am well, if a little dusty. Write soon.\n\nYour loving\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080577,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":206,"prompt_tokens":952,"total_tokens":1158,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-v7AbP95Ry0yEdH7RzFSw3dDOATVKAPxg","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":952,"prompt_ms":910.193,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9560850840336135,"prompt_per_second":1045.932016616256,"predicted_n":206,"predicted_ms":4908.823,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.94547804878049,"predicted_per_second":41.76153835654697}}